; UsedConsoles sign is mounted on the right wall (X=8.0) directly above
; the ConsoleShelf tower (world X=7.2, Z=-4.29, top at Y=2.4). The -90°
; Y-rotation flips the backing's readable face to point world -X (toward
; the sales floor), so a player approaching from the center aisle reads
; the sign without billboarding. Backing depth (0.03 m) sits flush
