; ============================================================
; Store atmosphere props — non-interactive diegetic identity panels
; layered on top of the existing storefront / interior signage. None
; carry collision or Interactable wrappers; they exist purely to
; communicate "this is a retail games store" from the player POV.
;
;   • SalePoster        — left-wall promotional poster, mid-store
;   • ReturnPolicySign  — small policy plaque near the checkout counter
;   • EmployeeNoteBoard — backroom note board behind the refurb bench,
;                         visually marking the employee-only space
; ============================================================

[node name="StoreAtmosphereProps" type="Node3D" parent="."]

; SalePoster — flush against the left wall (x=-8.05, 0.1 thick) at
; mid-store Z. Panel mesh is X-thin so the poster face points +X
; (toward the interior). Y range 1.25–2.15 sits above customer head
; height and clears the AccessoriesBin top (Y=1.0) further south.
[node name="SalePoster" type="Node3D" parent="StoreAtmosphereProps"]
