; RegisterStatusIndicator — passive raycast-only Interactable that surfaces
; a muted disabled-reason hint when the player aims at the register face
; during STAGE_BACK_ROOM_INVENTORY and STAGE_STOCK_SHELF (when neither
; StoreSessionDayOneCustomer nor StoreSessionDayEndTrigger is the active beat). The tight
; collision volume sits flush at the register screen so walking near the
; counter without targeting it does not steal focus from the active
; chain interactable elsewhere in the store.
