; ============================================================
; BRAINDUMP zone completeness.
;
; The nine BRAINDUMP-required zones live below. Each zone is a Node3D with at
; least one Interactable child. CartRackLeft / CartRackRight already cover the
; "used_game_wall" footprint and now also belong to the `used_game_wall`
; group; this top-level container hosts the wall-level Interactable so the
; player can examine the wall section. AccessoriesBin already serves as the
; accessories rack and now also belongs to the `accessories_rack` group.
; ============================================================

