; ============================================================
; ReadabilityProps — purely visual atmosphere props (floor display
; island, wall posters, bargain bin overflow, cart rack product
; stacks, zone identity accents, route markers, and zone fill lights).
; No scripts and no CollisionShape3D
; children so the controller (retro_games.gd) never sees these
; nodes and the baked navmesh (retro_games_navmesh.tres) is
; unaffected.
; ============================================================

